  "description": "Don't worry... we will have plenty of stocks to short",
  "body_html": "<p>Part of me hates this type of video. I know many of you will read this…grumble…some of you may even curse me. Thats ok, I started my creator journey on TikTok…I have some pretty thick skin. Regardless, my job priorities are: 1. Protect your money and 2. Make money. Today, I think we need a reminder of #1, especially as I read articles coming out about a “stock market blow off top”. <strong>The media ALWAYS reports in hindsight…and it was scary to see them today.</strong></p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ICls!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd9c25f8e-212c-4c76-8853-a4e654418c4d_685x430.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ICls!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd9c25f8e-212c-4c76-8853-a4e654418c4d_685x430.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ICls!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd9c25f8e-212c-4c76-8853-a4e654418c4d_685x430.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ICls!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd9c25f8e-212c-4c76-8853-a4e654418c4d_685x430.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ICls!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd9c25f8e-212c-4c76-8853-a4e654418c4d_685x430.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ICls!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd9c25f8e-212c-4c76-8853-a4e654418c4d_685x430.png\" width=\"685\" height=\"430\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/d9c25f8e-212c-4c76-8853-a4e654418c4d_685x430.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:430,&quot;width&quot;:685,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:94351,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/175530059?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd9c25f8e-212c-4c76-8853-a4e654418c4d_685x430.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ICls!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd9c25f8e-212c-4c76-8853-a4e654418c4d_685x430.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ICls!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd9c25f8e-212c-4c76-8853-a4e654418c4d_685x430.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ICls!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd9c25f8e-212c-4c76-8853-a4e654418c4d_685x430.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!ICls!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fd9c25f8e-212c-4c76-8853-a4e654418c4d_685x430.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">The media reporting on a “blow off top” stage, means it is in hindsight. We are seeing this on the charts as well. </figcaption></figure></div><p>This cycle has 4 stages: </p><ol><li><p>Bear Market (2022). Confirmed ✅</p></li><li><p>Melt-up (2023 to 2024): A strong bull market under poor economic conditions with low volume. Confirmed ✅</p></li><li><p>Blow-Off Top (Now): A euphoric ending to the bull market. Valuations hit insanity levels of most stocks and trash stocks go parabolic. </p></li><li><p>Melt-Down (future): A drastic crash ranging from -20% to -80% ending the cycle and bringing stocks to the reality of the economy. </p></li></ol><p>The most common retort I expect is: “The economy is great!”. Yes… most of the technical valuations of the health of the economy are “good”. But those valuations are largely based off corporations and government spending…NOT the health of the citizens. Look at home prices and grocery prices, and you tell me if this is a “healthy” economy. If you are wealthy…I know these factors may mean nothing to you….but you are in the minority and live in a different world from the majority of middle class and poor Americans. Data like savings rates, credit card delinquency, cost of living scales all confirm this.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mt_L!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F490c237f-e432-4791-8b2c-c8ccdb3b6166_3170x2056.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mt_L!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F490c237f-e432-4791-8b2c-c8ccdb3b6166_3170x2056.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mt_L!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F490c237f-e432-4791-8b2c-c8ccdb3b6166_3170x2056.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mt_L!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F490c237f-e432-4791-8b2c-c8ccdb3b6166_3170x2056.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mt_L!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F490c237f-e432-4791-8b2c-c8ccdb3b6166_3170x2056.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mt_L!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F490c237f-e432-4791-8b2c-c8ccdb3b6166_3170x2056.png\" width=\"1456\" height=\"944\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/490c237f-e432-4791-8b2c-c8ccdb3b6166_3170x2056.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:944,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:904835,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/i/175530059?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F490c237f-e432-4791-8b2c-c8ccdb3b6166_3170x2056.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mt_L!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F490c237f-e432-4791-8b2c-c8ccdb3b6166_3170x2056.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mt_L!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F490c237f-e432-4791-8b2c-c8ccdb3b6166_3170x2056.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mt_L!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F490c237f-e432-4791-8b2c-c8ccdb3b6166_3170x2056.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!mt_L!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F490c237f-e432-4791-8b2c-c8ccdb3b6166_3170x2056.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class=\"image-caption\">The last few months have been stronger than the last 2 years…and media is behind the curve…again!</figcaption></figure></div><p>Now, back to the point: Why do I think we are in the final blow off top phase? The biggest clue is that the S&amp;P 500 rose 41% in just 5 months. It took us 28 months to do the same through 2023 and 2024. That is DRASTIC. Additionally, knowing that the media always reports on hindsight…them reporting on a blow-off top now is very convincing they are once again operating in hindsight. They will not use foresight to talk about a melt-down. </p><p>Additionally, junk stocks are going wild on the charts. Up up up. </p><p>I am not saying to sell everything. Nor am I calling a top. Im trying to hammer home to you, to be aggressive about taking profits, setting stops. Its ok to call it quits and to protect the 3 years of gains we have made. I’ve seen it over and over again: people who made astounding unrealized gains…only to give it all back in the end. </p><p>I apologize for the “negative” article and post today. But I see some people losing their senses. Don’t be apart of the majority later, who will be wallowing in despair. </p><p>I’ll keep you updated as we progress. </p><p>Thanks for stopping by 👍</p><p></p>",
